# Nanoporous silica glass: 192,000 atoms of amorphous SiO2 with 75%
# porosity, 23 nm across, the structure from the Atomify web app. Drawn
# with billboards; use Step inside to fly through the pores.
#/atom 1 silicon
#/atom 2 oxygen

units metal
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
read_data nanoporous_sio2.data

pair_style vashishta/table 10000 0.5
pair_coeff * * SiO2.vashishta Si O
neigh_modify every 10 delay 0 check yes

mass 1 28.08
mass 2 15.9994

fix nvt all nvt temp 300 300 1.0
timestep 0.002

thermo_style one
thermo 10
run 1000000
